<title>USA: Red Lion in talks with Doubletree.</title>
<headline>Red Lion in talks with Doubletree.</headline>
<dateline>VANCOUVER, Wash. 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Red Lion Hotels Inc said on Wednesday that it is having preliminary discussions about being acquired by Doubletree Corp.</p>
<p>Red Lion said the discussions are still at an early stage and may not lead to a definitive agreement. The company said the discussions do not involve the Red Lion Inns LP.</p>
